direction: down

Q: 新查询进入 {class: base}
L1: "max_memory_usage\n单查询硬顶" {shape: diamond; class: base}
Reject: "主动报错\n进程不死" {class: warn}
L2: "聚合/排序中间态\n大于 spill 阈值?" {shape: diamond; class: base}
Spill: "external_group_by/sort\n溢出到磁盘, 慢但不崩" {class: warn}
Run: 正常执行 {class: base}
L3: "进程 RSS 仍超 cgroup?" {shape: diamond; class: base}
Kill: "supervisor 拉起\n兜底, 应极少触发" {class: hot}
OK: 返回结果 {class: ok}

Q -> L1
L1 -> Reject: 超限
L1 -> L2: 未超
L2 -> Spill: 是
L2 -> Run: 否
Spill -> Run
Run -> L3
L3 -> Kill: 是
L3 -> OK: 否
